<section class="app-overview__section">
    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m app-overview__section-heading">This school cannot be compared with similar schools</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">
        This could be because the school:
    </p>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet app-overview__list">
        <li>had no pupils completing KS2 or KS4 when the most recent data was release</li>
        <li>recently changed type, for example became an academy</li>
        <li>reopened after a previous school school closed</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="app-overview__section">
    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m app-overview__section-heading">Compare data from previous academic years</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">
        If the school changed type or reopened, performance data from previous academic years may be available on the former school's page.
    </p>
    <p class="govuk-body">
        If the school has performance data from previous academic years, you can compare against:
    </p>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet app-overview__list">
        <li>the local authority average</li>
        <li>the national average</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="app-overview__section">
    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m app-overview__section-heading">If you expected to see similar schools</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">
        If you think this school has recent KS2 or KS4 performance data and should be compared to similar schools, contact the support team at ...
    </p>
</section>